== Aftermath ==
Bidois held the seat for two years before being defeated at the [[2020 New Zealand general election|2020 general election]] by Halbert.<ref>{{cite web |title=Northcote – Official Result |url=https://electionresults.govt.nz/electionresults_2020/electorate-details-31.html |publisher=[[Electoral Commission (New Zealand)|Electoral Commission]] |date=6 November 2020 |access-date=8 November 2020 }}</ref>

Bidois regained the seat at the 2023 general election, recording a majority of 9,270 over Halbert.<ref>{{Cite web |title=Northcote – Official Result |url=https://www.electionresults.govt.nz/electionresults_2023/electorate-details-31.html |access-date=31 December 2023 |website=electionresults.govt.nz}}</ref>

